1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,750
You might pass them tomorrow.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,850
At the grocery store.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,550
On the sidewalk.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,150
Waiting beside you at a stoplight.

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,150
And never know.

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:21,250
Never know that tonight, a family will sit down to dinner with a little less worry.

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,250
That a child has somewhere safe to go after school.

8
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:30,650
That a student is beginning to believe the future holds a place for them.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,350
You may never see those moments.

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,950
But you can help make them possible.

11
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:42,750
When you give to support Troy through The Troy Foundation, your generosity gets to work right here.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,950
Through local organizations.

13
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,350
Through people who know our neighbors.

14
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,650
Through opportunities that help this community thrive.

15
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,250
Together, our gifts become something deeply personal.

16
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,750
Food on a table.

17
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,950
A door that stays open.

18
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:01,450
A chance to begin again.

19
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,150
And the impact keeps going.

20
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,550
A child grows in confidence.

21
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:09,850
A family finds its footing.

22
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:14,250
Someone who once needed a hand finds a way to offer one.

23
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,050
You may never know their name.

24
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:19,550
They may never know yours.

25
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,350
But your lives are connected.

26
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,450
By a gift.

27
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:26,050
By this place.

28
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:29,750
By the belief that we can care for one another.

29
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,750
The Troy Foundation.

30
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,350
Give here.

31
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,350
Help change a life here.

32
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,350
You may never see the moment.

33
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,950
But someone will live it.
